    "description": "Procedure documentation (#2375): heading"
  },
  "gobdProcedureSystemBody": "DesKilo keeps this space's invoices, credit notes, payments, member accounts, shared costs and approved purchase documents. It is a sub-ledger: the general ledger and the annual accounts are kept by the accountant in their own system, which imports the DATEV export.",
